      "created_at": "2025-05-06T09:35:13.096Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can create a Notification with the “Send Alert On” option set to <strong>Custom</strong>. Then, in the <code>on_update</code>, <code>on_change</code>, or any relevant hook of the <strong>Workstation</strong> Doctype, add your condition and use code to manually trigger the Notification when needed. This gives you full control over when the alert is sent.</p>",
